  m_text: "Enter maintenance through the marked door.\n\nGrab two pieces of metal,
    bring them to the booth, and weld them together.\n\nPlace the welded material
    on the green desk, then press the button to submit your work.\n\nRetrieve the
    damaged fuel cell.\n\nCarefully bring the fuel cell to the welding booth and
    weld over any cracks. \n\nSubmit the fuel cell at the green desk when you believe
    you have finished. Retrieve and put on the welding mask."
